    "created_at": "2024-12-16 12:00:00",
    "first_name": "Amber",
    "known_as": "Lovely and Very Tolerant Kitty",
    "last_name": "Shakespeare",
    "likes_eating": "Tuna, Go-Cat",
    "likes_to": "Sit in the widest variety of places imaginable. One of the funniest was when she sat facing a brick wall, probably for a good 30 minutes. She also thoroughly enjoyed sharing office chairs with her family members.",
    "middle_name": "",
    "passed_in": "2010-05-14",
    "profile_photo": "lovely_amber_nxG8j1aBBzSN.webp",
    "story": "As a young rescued kitten, Amber was quickly adopted by the Shakespeares as their third child and only daughter. Growing up with 2 young children from such a young age herself, she developed incredible tolerance and learnt to deal with all kinds of annoyances and tricks pulled against her. One classic example is when the Shakespeares' 2 young children built a K'NEX cat cage around her, and what did she do? Well, despite the clear build up of immense agitation perceived from the look on her face, she sat there calmly while the children constructed the cage piece by piece until she was sufficiently trapped in the rather tight and claustrophobic structure. She was a remarkable cat and one of the most loving pets anyone could ever have. She will forever be remembered as a true legend and gem of all cats and pets alike.",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-16 12:00:00",
